{
  "schema": "dungeon-scroller/turnarounds@1",
  "kind": "turnarounds",
  "notes": [
    "Reference pictures of a character or object seen from four sides, left to right: front, three-quarter (45 degrees), side (90 degrees) and back (180 degrees). The order is as the artist described it.",
    "These images have no written guide. Everything here was measured from the pictures; nothing about what they show has been assumed.",
    "Each picture is named after the game entity it shows ('subject'), which is how the two are linked.",
    "The pictures are painted on a plain grey-blue ground, not a transparent one, and the ground is slightly uneven. 'views' are the areas that differ clearly from it, found by splitting at the three widest empty gaps, so their edges are good to a few pixels, not exact.",
    "'narrowestGap' is the smallest of those three gaps in pixels. Where it is small the views nearly touch and a rectangle may clip or include a neighbour's edge.",
    "The pictures come in two sizes, 1774 x 887 and 3200 x 1600. Both are 2:1.",
    "'withoutPicture' lists entities that have no turnaround yet."
  ],
  "viewOrder": [
    "front",
    "three_quarter",
    "side",
    "back"
  ],
